mathematical task is deferred for absent figures. Future choice units must
preserve all data and complete response results, not individual numeric slots.
Shared-definition classification/formula/example lists can remain native
multiple-select; truly independent initial-value or domain systems can have
separate complete-result questions. Lost unaided written calculations,
derivations, and example construction must be named internally and in coverage.
No choice response will be described as proof of independent written production.
